"SpeechAnalysisAVL" "Rob van Son" 20260908 0
<intro> "%%Praat% script that combines a number of scripts to analyse voicing, voice quality, and vowel spaces. "

<entry> "There are 4 scripts available:"

<list_item> "\bu %%AVQI% - Acoustic Voice Quality Index"
<definition> "Calculates voice quality on a scale of 0-10 based on a sustained vowel (3s) and continuous speech (4s) \\n %%Only available if separate AVQI script is available%"
<list_item> "\bu %%Vowel Triangle%"
<definition> "Plots a vowel triangle of the vowels in a speech recording"
<list_item> "\bu %%Pitch and Intensity ranges%"
<definition> "A simplified phonetogram (Intensity x F0)"
<list_item> "\bu %%Vowel Bender%"
<definition> "Converts typical speech into hemiglossectomy speech with a restricted vowel space"
